   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Interventions/investigations:",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=5535-5564",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s3",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Dyspnea: Mr. ___ was recently hospitalized at ___",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=5565-5616",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s4",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ with dyspnea and was diuresed without marked subjective \nbenefit but had significant worsening a few days after \ndischarge.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=5618-5745",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s5",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He had a TTE ___ showing evidence of elevated RV \npressures and severe pulmonary HTN.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=5746-5831",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s6",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He had only mild evidence of \nvolume overload on exam but improved with gentle diuresis.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=5832-5920",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s8",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "He also has a newly identified lung mass of unknown \netiology which may have been contributing.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=5999-6094",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s9",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Given his cough, he \nwas also treated empirically for CAP with levofloxacin (5 days \nantibiotics, 3 days of levofloxacin following 2 days of \ndoxycycline).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6095-6250",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s10",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "A CTA was negative for PE.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6251-6277",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s11",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Pulmonology was \nconsulted and felt this was unlikely to be an ILD flare and his",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6278-6358",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s12",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "CT showed stable pulmonary fibrosis.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6360-6396",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s13",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "In addition, he has failed \ntreatment with prednisone and profenidone and does not have any \nother available ILD therapies given his comorbidities.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6397-6544",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s14",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "# Lung mass: Patient had a recently identified RUL lung mass on \nan outside CT from ___.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6547-6635",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s16",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "___ and to undergo EBUS/TBNA on ___ to stage the mass.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6674-6728",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s17",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "However, \nafter consultation with IP and oncology, it was determined to \nforgo biopsy.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6729-6815",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s18",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Biopsy would be high risk in him, especially as \nstopping Plavix is very high risk in him (he developed an MI \nafter stopping Plavix in the past).",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6816-6962",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s19",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Furthermore, he does not \nwish to pursue surgery or chemotherapy and treatment options are \nvery limited due to his many comorbidities.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=6963-7098",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "DS:HC:s20",
   "source": "discharge_note",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "HC",
   "available_at": null,
   "text": "Also, a malignancy \nwould not necessarily shorten his lifespan given his pulmonary \nfibrosis.",
   "provenance": "discharge:note_id=12050390-DS-21:chars=7099-7192",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
