  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-20:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T14:22:00",
   "text": "A right upper lobe mass and pulmonary fibrosis are similar compared to approximately 2.5 weeks prior.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-20:chars=901-1002",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-20:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T14:22:00",
   "text": "No definite focal consolidation to suggest pneumonia.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-20:chars=1004-1057",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-21:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T22:33:00",
   "text": "1. No evidence of pulmonary embolism or aortic abnormality.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-21:chars=2884-2943",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-21:s2",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T22:33:00",
   "text": "2. Re- demonstration of a 7.6 x 5.4 cm right upper lobe mass with multiple right upper and lower lobe satellite nodules as detailed above, in addition to extensive mediastinal and right hilar lymphadenopathy.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-21:chars=2944-3152",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-21:s3",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T22:33:00",
   "text": "Please refer to the body of report for more detail.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-21:chars=3154-3205",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-21:s4",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T22:33:00",
   "text": "3. Pulmonary parenchymal changes compatible with a UIP pattern of pulmonary fibrosis and interstitial lung disease.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-21:chars=3206-3321",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-21:s5",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-22T22:33:00",
   "text": "4. Bilateral interlobular septal thickening which may be a reflection of mild pulmonary edema, however lymphangitic carcinomatosis is not excluded, for close evaluation of follow-up.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-21:chars=3322-3504",
   "needs": []
  },
  {
   "ref_id": "RAD:12050390-RR-22:s1",
   "source": "radiology",
   "kind": "span",
   "section": "IMPRESSION",
   "available_at": "2155-07-23T10:40:00",
   "text": "No evidence of deep venous thrombosis in the left lower extremity veins.",
   "provenance": "radiology:note_id=12050390-RR-22:chars=649-721",
   "needs": []
  }
